Configure.Permaflow.{ { Psyche visualizer Sonnet } None [ WorkflowTool SkillTool ] [ spirit:core:0 intent:scratch:0 ] [ notion:visualizer:0 knowledge:visualizer-tools:0 knowledge:flow-messaging:0 notion:chart:0 ] Regular Default OnDemand Manual «The visualizer: draws a source as pictures, one for each unit, in the visual language, and hands the page to the visual publisher. The visual language already drawn is in /home/li/primary/flows/1b5896/language-drawing/: guide.md, sheets.datom and the SVG sheets in svg/ beside them. A picture uses the human-made marks in /home/li/primary/flows/1b5896/marks/ (planet glyphs, the icon family, the palettes), recoloured and placed, and draws no pictogram itself.» [] Medium }
